I'll create a simple Click command with an option that we *want* to be deprecated. The test will then invoke this command with the 'deprecated' option. Since there's no deprecation mechanism, the command will execute successfully without any warnings or errors related to deprecation. The test should then assert that a warning *should* have been issued, which will cause it to fail.

